  "steps": [
    "Put a big bowl in the fridge to cool. Mix gelatine with water in a small glass.",
    "Add cream, milk, lemongrass and ginger to a pot on medium; heat until simmering (~6\u20138 min).",
    "Remove from heat; rest 10 minutes to infuse. Remove lemongrass and ginger; add gelatine; whisk 20 seconds.",
    "Add skyr to cold bowl; pour in cream mixture; whisk until smooth.",
    "Stir on counter 5 minutes to prevent fat separation. Distribute into 5 containers; refrigerate 2+ hours."
